type: software
title: "Bulgarian-solitaire conjectures: two counterexamples and verification certificates"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Cinna
repository-code: "https://github.com/1337isnot1337/solved-conjectures"
url: "https://github.com/1337isnot1337/solved-conjectures"
abstract: >-
  Two unrefereed notes concerning Bulgarian-solitaire conjectures: a
  counterexample to the published L-solitaire limit-shape conjecture and
  a counterexample to Pham's original exact denominator-degree conjecture,
  together with proofs, certificates, and reproducible verification code.
